{
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": { "type": "grafana", "uid": "-- Grafana --" },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "description": "Métricas RED, logs e correlação com traces do serviço Go de exemplo.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Taxa de requisição",
      "description": "Requisições por segundo somando todas as rotas instrumentadas.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 2,
          "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "text" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "text", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_requests_total{job=\"go-app\", route=~\"$route\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "req/s"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Taxa de erro",
      "description": "Fatia das requisições respondidas com 5xx. O app falha ~8% das chamadas de /work de propósito (os ~3% de 4xx não entram aqui).",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 2,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "#EAB839", "value": 0.05 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.15 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_requests_total{job=\"go-app\", route=~\"$route\", status=~\"5..\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(http_requests_total{job=\"go-app\", route=~\"$route\"}[5m])), 1e-9)",
          "legendFormat": "taxa de erro"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Latência p95",
      "description": "Percentil 95 da duração das requisições.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 3,
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "#EAB839", "value": 0.5 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"go-app\", route=~\"$route\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Requisições ativas",
      "description": "Requisições sendo atendidas agora. Um número que só sobe e não volta significa handler travado.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "text" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "text", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(http_requests_in_flight{job=\"go-app\"})",
          "legendFormat": "ativas"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Taxa de requisição por rota",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 2,
          "min": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "gradientMode": "opacity",
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": { "group": "A", "mode": "none" },
            "axisSoftMin": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "showLegend": true, "calcs": ["mean", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (route) (rate(http_requests_total{job=\"go-app\", route=~\"$route\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Erros por rota (5xx)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 2,
          "min": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 70,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": { "group": "A", "mode": "normal" },
            "axisSoftMin": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "showLegend": true, "calcs": ["mean", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (route) (rate(http_requests_total{job=\"go-app\", route=~\"$route\", status=~\"5..\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Percentis de latência",
      "description": "Os pontinhos são exemplars. Clique num deles para cair direto no trace que gerou aquela amostra de latência.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 13 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 3,
          "min": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "gradientMode": "opacity",
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "axisSoftMin": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "exemplar": true,
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"go-app\", route=~\"$route\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "exemplar": true,
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"go-app\", route=~\"$route\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "exemplar": true,
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"go-app\", route=~\"$route\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heatmap",
      "title": "Distribuição de latência",
      "description": "O histograma inteiro ao longo do tempo. Linha de percentil esconde comportamento bimodal; heatmap não.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 13 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "custom": { "hideFrom": { "legend": false, "tooltip": false, "viz": false } } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": {
        "calculate": false,
        "cellGap": 1,
        "color": { "mode": "scheme", "scheme": "Turbo", "steps": 64, "reverse": false, "exponent": 0.5, "fill": "dark-orange" },
        "exemplars": { "color": "rgba(255,0,255,0.7)" },
        "filterValues": { "le": 1e-9 },
        "legend": { "show": true },
        "rowsFrame": { "layout": "auto" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single", "yHistogram": true },
        "yAxis": { "axisPlacement": "left", "reverse": false, "unit": "s" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "heatmap",
          "exemplar": true,
          "expr": "sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"go-app\", route=~\"$route\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{le}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Logs",
      "description": "Logs JSON estruturados entregues pelo Alloy. Expanda uma linha e clique no TraceID para abrir o trace correspondente no Tempo.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 11, "w": 16, "x": 0, "y": 22 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": false,
        "showCommonLabels": false,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": false,
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "sortOrder": "Descending"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "queryType": "range",
          "expr": "{container=\"go-app\"} | json | line_format \"{{.level}} {{.msg}}{{if .route}} route={{.route}} status={{.status}} duration_ms={{.duration_ms}}{{end}}\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Como usar este dashboard",
      "gridPos": { "h": 11, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 22 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Siga uma requisição pelos três pilares\n\n**1. Métrica → trace**\nNo painel *Percentis de latência*, clique num dos pontinhos (exemplars). Ele abre no Tempo exatamente o trace por trás daquela amostra de latência.\n\n**2. Log → trace**\nExpanda qualquer linha do painel *Logs* e clique no link **TraceID**.\n\n**3. Trace → logs**\nDentro do trace, use *Logs for this span* para voltar às linhas que aquele span emitiu.\n\n---\n\n### Vale experimentar\n\n- **Service graph**: Explore → Tempo → aba *Service Graph*. Sai das span metrics, sem instrumentação extra.\n- **Só erros**: troque a query do painel de logs por `{container=\"go-app\"} | json | level=\"ERROR\"`.\n- **Runtime do Go**: goroutines, heap e GC estão no outro dashboard.\n- **Alertas**: as regras estão em `prometheus/rules/`; o estado fica no [Alertmanager](http://localhost:9093).\n\n---\n\n*De propósito, o app responde ~3% das chamadas de `/work` com 400, falha ~8% com 500 e manda 10% pelo caminho lento. Sem isso estes painéis não teriam o que mostrar.*"
      }
    }
  ],
